      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"34\">ONE DATASET, TWO CONCLUSIONS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Only the right-hand axis range differs</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"140\" width=\"500\" height=\"560\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"20\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">VERSION A: falls axis 8 to 15</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Reads: falls track overtime</text><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"600\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"102\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"15\">260</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"606\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"15\">200</text><text x=\"508\" y=\"308\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"15\">15</text><text x=\"508\" y=\"606\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"15\">8</text><polyline points=\"120,540 194,460 268,395 342,420 416,340 490,365\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polyline points=\"120,514 194,429 268,471 342,386 416,429 490,343\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"540\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"460\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"395\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"420\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"416\" cy=\"340\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"490\" cy=\"365\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"514\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"194\" cy=\"429\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"268\" cy=\"471\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"386\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"416\" cy=\"429\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"490\" cy=\"343\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Jan</text><text x=\"194\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Feb</text><text x=\"268\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Mar</text><text x=\"342\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Apr</text><text x=\"416\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">May</text><text x=\"490\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Jun</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"662\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"662\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"668\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Overtime hrs</text><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"662\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"662\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"668\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Falls</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"140\" width=\"500\" height=\"560\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.1)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"20\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"bold\">VERSION B: falls axis 0 to 40</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Reads: falls barely moved</text><line x1=\"620\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"620\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1020\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"1020\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"620\" y1=\"600\" x2=\"1020\" y2=\"600\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"612\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"15\">260</text><text x=\"612\" y=\"606\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"15\">200</text><text x=\"1028\" y=\"308\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"15\">40</text><text x=\"1028\" y=\"606\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"15\">0</text><polyline points=\"630,540 706,460 782,395 858,420 934,340 1010,365\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><polyline points=\"630,525 706,510 782,518 858,503 934,510 1010,495\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"630\" cy=\"540\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"706\" cy=\"460\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"782\" cy=\"395\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"858\" cy=\"420\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"934\" cy=\"340\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"1010\" cy=\"365\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"/><circle cx=\"630\" cy=\"525\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"706\" cy=\"510\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"782\" cy=\"518\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"858\" cy=\"503\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"934\" cy=\"510\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><circle cx=\"1010\" cy=\"495\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><text x=\"630\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Jan</text><text x=\"706\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Feb</text><text x=\"782\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Mar</text><text x=\"858\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Apr</text><text x=\"934\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">May</text><text x=\"1010\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Jun</text><line x1=\"650\" y1=\"662\" x2=\"690\" y2=\"662\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"700\" y=\"668\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Overtime hrs</text><line x1=\"850\" y1=\"662\" x2=\"890\" y2=\"662\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><text x=\"900\" y=\"668\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Falls</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"730\" width=\"1020\" height=\"320\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"20\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Identical numbers in both panels.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Only the right-hand axis range changed.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">r = 0.64 across six months</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"905\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">Critical r at df = 4 is 0.811 — not significant</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"945\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"21\">Census rose 9% in the same window.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"21\">If you need two axes, use two charts.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Meadowbrook's overtime and falls data on two dual-axis charts that argue the opposite"
